{"4382850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gunshot Survivors VR", "steam_appid": 4382850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunshot Survivors VR is a VR roguelike shooter where you upgrade your gun and defeat enemies to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate gun and defeat the robot swarm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave lasts 30 to 60 seconds. Survive all 12 waves in a single run. <br>Shoot down enemies attacking from all directions and use dashes to evade them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382850/extras/42e757e79defe56bfe9d2a7e614c945b.poster.avif?t=1787389554\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382850/extras/42e757e79defe56bfe9d2a7e614c945b.webm?t=1787389554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382850/extras/42e757e79defe56bfe9d2a7e614c945b.mp4?t=1787389554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOSS BATTLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every certain number of WAVEs, a boss battle different from regular battles occurs. <br>Each boss has unique characteristics and unleashes powerful attacks. <br>And when you defeat the boss, you can get special upgrades, so aim to take it down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382850/extras/3bfca3835d23a7bcc70bcaa20fdffb4f.poster.avif?t=1787389554\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382850/extras/3bfca3835d23a7bcc70bcaa20fdffb4f.webm?t=1787389554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382850/extras/3bfca3835d23a7bcc70bcaa20fdffb4f.mp4?t=1787389554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When WAVE ends, you can spend the energy gained from defeating enemies to buy upgrades. <br>Combining the same upgrades can make them stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382850/extras/66368a2e406f4706244d922f6aed9368.poster.avif?t=1787389554\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382850/extras/66368a2e406f4706244d922f6aed9368.webm?t=1787389554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4382850/extras/66368a2e406f4706244d922f6aed9368.mp4?t=1787389554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERMANENT UPGRADE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon completing the run, you can obtain gems. <br>Use gems to get permanent upgrades and power up your initial stats. <br>Whether you choose to compensate for your weaknesses or enhance your strengths, feel free to mix and match according to your own playstyle.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunshot Survivors VR is a VR roguelike shooter where you upgrade your gun and defeat enemies to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate gun and defeat the robot swarm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave lasts 30 to 60 seconds. Survive all 12 waves in a single run. <br>Shoot down enemies attacking from all directions and use dashes to evade them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http